{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901038400010","name":"透","text":"──おー……本命すか","trans":"──哦～……本命啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははは\r\nクッキーはクッキーだよ","trans":"哈哈哈\n曲奇就是曲奇啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038400020","name":"透","text":"あざーす\r\n私も、じゃ────","trans":"谢啦\n那我也，来────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038400030","name":"透","text":"────はい\r\nお返しリスト０番、プロデューサー様","trans":"────给\n回礼清单0号，制作人大人","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"えっ\r\nおお……！","trans":"诶\n哦哦……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ありがとう、頂くよ\r\n────０番？","trans":"谢谢，我收下了\n────0号？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038400050","name":"透","text":"何番がよかった？","trans":"你想要几号？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？\r\nいや、とくにそんな────","trans":"诶？\n不，并不是特别────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038400060","name":"透","text":"１番？","trans":"1号？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901038400070","name":"透","text":"────いいよ、１番でも","trans":"────可以哦，1号也行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}